            s-17-7.626-17-17S14.61,6,23.984,6z"></path></svg></div><div class="ot-fltr-cntr"><button id="filter-btn-handler" aria-label="Фильтр Список файлов cookie" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 402.577 402.577" xml:space="preserve"><title>Filter Icon</title><g><path fill="#fff" d="M400.858,11.427c-3.241-7.421-8.85-11.132-16.854-11.136H18.564c-7.993,0-13.61,3.715-16.846,11.136
